   "title": "Lee calls for unity at dinner meeting with DPK leaders",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/southkorea/20261112/lee-calls-for-unity-at-dinner-meeting-with-dpk-leaders",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
