   "title": "S. Korea pledges $20 mil. to ADB fund for AI projects",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/economy/20261111/s-korea-pledges-20-mil-to-adb-fund-for-ai-projects",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
