   "title": "Finance minister calls for close monitoring of US midterms impact",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/economy/20261111/finance-minister-calls-for-close-monitoring-of-us-midterms-impact",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
