   "title": "Young India Residential Schools to be ready from next academic year: Telangana Deputy CM",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/telangana/young-india-residential-schools-to-be-ready-from-next-academic-year-telangana-deputy-cm/article71689442.ece",
