   "_dt": 1794387424.0,
   "ageDays": 0.63,
   "summary": "Prime Minister Han Seong-sook pledged Wednesday to create a better environment for farmers, saying the government has set aside the largest-ever budget for farming for next year. Han said in an address at a Farmers' Day ceremony that the government has earmarked more than 3 trillion won ($2.2 billion) in subsidies for farmers, known as \"public interest direct payment,\" the first time the budget has exceeded the 3 trillion-won mark.",
   "summary_zh": "韩国总理韩升效周三承诺为农民创造更好的环境，并表示政府已为明年的农业预留了史上规模最大的预算。韩升效在农民节典礼上致辞称，政府已划拨超过3万亿韩元（22亿美元）的农民补贴，这笔资金被称为“公共利益直接支付”；这是该预算首次突破3万亿韩元大关。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Prime Minister Han Seong-sook pledged Wednesday to create a better environment for farmers, saying the government has set aside the largest-ever budget for farming for next year. Han said in an address at a Farmers' Day ceremony that the government has earmarked more than 3 trillion won ($2.2 billion) in subsidies for farmers, known as \"public interest direct payment,\" the first time the budget has exceeded the 3 trillion-won mark. She also said the government more than tripled the budget for the rural basic income from some 300 billion won to more than 1.1 trillion won for next year and will keep increasing the budget going forward. The government is also preparing to introduce retirement pension for farmers, she said. \"The president said last month that agriculture is a national security industry and a strategic industry that is essential to the survival of the Republic of Korea,\" Han said. \"First of all, I believe that creating an environment where farmers can work with peace of mind is crucial for safeguarding agricultural security.\" \"Expanding smart farming is of vital importance for the future,\" she said. \"By investing in physical AI, such as AI-powered agricultural machinery and farming robots, we can prepare for the future of our agricultural sector.\"",
