   "title": "Police chief nominee's confirmation hearing set for Nov. 18",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/southkorea/20261111/police-chief-nominees-confirmation-hearing-set-for-nov-18",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
