   "title": "AFP to VP: Defending PH rights isn’t ‘picking a fight with China’",
   "url": "https://www.inquirer.net/495284/afp-to-vp-defending-ph-rights-isnt-picking-a-fight-with-china/",
   "domain": "inquirer.net",
