   "title": "Gov't to release growth forecasts 3 times per year: finance minister",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/economy/20261111/govt-to-release-growth-forecasts-3-times-per-year-finance-minister",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
