   "title": "S. Korea, US top diplomats discuss N. Korea, bilateral issues in Paris",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/foreignaffairs/others/20261110/s-korea-us-top-diplomats-discuss-n-korea-bilateral-issues-in-paris",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
