   "title": "[COVER STORY] Iran's warning shows Seoul's diplomatic outreach on Cheonghae mission insufficient",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/foreignaffairs/20261110/cover-story-irans-warning-shows-seouls-diplomatic-outreach-on-cheonghae-mission-insufficient",
