   "title": "Government to unveil four-year ‘New Economy’ plan in 2027 Budget",
   "url": "https://www.myjoyonline.com/government-to-unveil-four-year-new-economy-plan-in-2027-budget-kwakye-ofosu/",
   "domain": "myjoyonline.com",
