   "url": "https://x.com/sinoprise/status/2120299464565109057",
   "snippet": "The 2026 China (Guangxi)-ASEAN Mining Cooperation Conference kicked off on Friday in Nanning, capital of Guangxi Zhuang autonomous region in South China. The event brought together more than 300 representatives and, for the first time, included Ghanaian mining officials in its training program. \n\nDuring the conference, Ghanaian delegation explored opportunities to learn from Guangxi's mining technologies and industrial experience. Through technology sharing, skills development and stronger partnerships, the two sides aim to support a more modern and responsible mining sector in Ghana.\n#EnterprisingChina #MiningCooperation #ChinaAfrica #TechnologyTransfer #SustainableMining",
