   "platform": "x",
   "title": "One of the major highlights of the NACCIMA B2B Investment Forum in Guanghzou, China was the presentation of specific projects and investment",
   "url": "https://x.com/IamAhmadShooto/status/2120207230037275106",
   "snippet": "One of the major highlights of the NACCIMA B2B Investment Forum in Guanghzou, China was the presentation of specific projects and investment proposals by the Nigerian delegates to attract partnership, support, and technical collaboration from interested Chinese investors.\n\nVice Chancellor of the University of Ilorin (UNILORIN), Prof. Wahab Olasupo Egbewole, SAN, made a compelling case for partnership and investment in the institution, showcasing its huge potential in agriculture, industrial park, power generation, and others.\n\nSimilarly, Arc. Zakirudeen Oladotun of Infrabridge Advisory Development Limited lined up a number of projects in need of technical and financial partnership for their actualisation, calling on the Chinese investors to take keen interest in them as the Return on Investment (RoI) are projected to be high.\n\nOther investment presentations came from representatives of Alaro City, Lekki Worldwide Investments Ltd, and Nigerian Office for Trade Negotiations.\n\nThe @NACCIMA30 B2B event provided a platform for solid partnership, collaboration, and networking between key players and business leaders in both Nigeria and China.\n\n#NACCIMAB2BForum\n#UNILORIN\n#Infrabridge",
   "body": "One of the major highlights of the NACCIMA B2B Investment Forum in Guanghzou, China was the presentation of specific projects and investment proposals by the Nigerian delegates to attract partnership, support, and technical collaboration from interested Chinese investors.\n\nVice Chancellor of the University of Ilorin (UNILORIN), Prof. Wahab Olasupo Egbewole, SAN, made a compelling case for partnership and investment in the institution, showcasing its huge potential in agriculture, industrial park, power generation, and others.\n\nSimilarly, Arc. Zakirudeen Oladotun of Infrabridge Advisory Development Limited lined up a number of projects in need of technical and financial partnership for their actualisation, calling on the Chinese investors to take keen interest in them as the Return on Investment (RoI) are projected to be high.\n\nOther investment presentations came from representatives of Alaro City, Lekki Worldwide Investments Ltd, and Nigerian Office for Trade Negotiations.\n\nThe @NACCIMA30 B2B event provided a platform for solid partnership, collaboration, and networking between key players and business leaders in both Nigeria and China.\n\n#NACCIMAB2BForum\n#UNILORIN\n#Infrabridge",
